人。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"子供好きで、弘樹を息子同様に可愛がっている。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"193512"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/6b/6b3b2e47016b98bac662ef60d359bc850f7fd90def11fe15f64de0c7fc62c199.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/13/136a1dc017501e8f445c2da2dc27a77904443ff54ee155412c34a96d0b9f9e06.webp","width":192,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"北条 明日香","creatorId":"vndb:s1016","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1016","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1016","name":"北条 明日香","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:32282","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_c24935","characterName":"木津 千里","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"193516","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"74112"}],"egsCharacterIds":["11344"],"vndbCharacterId":"c24935"},"originalCharacterName":"木津 千里","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Mama club member."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is a housewife and has one son. She is a well-known educational mother in her school district and sends her son to several cram schools."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Her son rarely participates in clubs, but her participation rate is relatively high by comparison. However, she is feared by the boys because of her strict manner."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From official site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c24935"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"クラスでもちょっと知れた教育ママ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"息子に塾を掛け持ちさせている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"本人も気が強く、ともすれば陰険な印象。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"11344","sourceWorkId":"14516","spoiler":fa